    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a journey in <strong>Like Others, But About Construction</strong> \u2014 a game where you have no choice but to climb to the top by overcoming physical challenges and building amazing structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247410/extras/13769e57e2a8f87241565cc3cc74b7bd.avif?t=1728116674\" data-has-big width=800 height=650 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Construction:</strong> Start your odyssey on a partially destroyed construction site, using a hammer to secure objects. Combine different items and build something grand! The stability of your constructions relies on clever use of physics \u2014 don\u2019t let them collapse!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material Evolution:</strong> As you climb higher, you will find and utilize better building materials. From simple bricks and chairs to luxurious items \u2014 your construction will grow and change as you ascend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Control Mechanics:</strong> Control with both hands: one for lifting objects and the other for securing them with a hammer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics and Challenges:</strong> Every decision you make matters. Build wisely, or your constructions may not withstand the load. Long bridges can lead to falls if you\u2019re not careful!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Gameplay Approach:</strong> Seek optimal paths and building methods to overcome obstacles and reach the top.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247410/extras/6a709ba10b636498587ae80e7b5ea3e9.poster.avif?t=1728116674\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247410/extras/6a709ba10b636498587ae80e7b5ea3e9.webm?t=1728116674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247410/extras/6a709ba10b636498587ae80e7b5ea3e9.mp4?t=1728116674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to challenge the laws of physics?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into Like Others, But About Construction and test your skills in this engaging building game.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a journey in <strong>Like Others, But About Construction</strong> \u2014 a game where you have no choice but to climb to the top by overcoming physical challenges and building amazing structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247410/extras/13769e57e2a8f87241565cc3cc74b7bd.avif?t=1728116674\" data-has-big width=800 height=650 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Construction:</strong> Start your odyssey on a partially destroyed construction site, using a hammer to secure objects. Combine different items and build something grand! The stability of your constructions relies on clever use of physics \u2014 don\u2019t let them collapse!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material Evolution:</strong> As you climb higher, you will find and utilize better building materials. From simple bricks and chairs to luxurious items \u2014 your construction will grow and change as you ascend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Control Mechanics:</strong> Control with both hands: one for lifting objects and the other for securing them with a hammer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics and Challenges:</strong> Every decision you make matters. Build wisely, or your constructions may not withstand the load. Long bridges can lead to falls if you\u2019re not careful!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Gameplay Approach:</strong> Seek optimal paths and building methods to overcome obstacles and reach the top.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247410/extras/6a709ba10b636498587